      "summary_en": "Nunu increases the attack speed and Move Speed of Willump and a nearby ally, and causes Willump's basic attacks to damage enemies around the target.",
      "summary_zh": "努努提升威朗普和一名附近友军的攻击速度和移动速度，并使威朗普的普攻可以伤害目标周围的敌人。",
